# good: a Jr 3 V lamp on the Jr battery holder, through the Beginner's slide switch and wires.
kits scb20, sc100
grid 7x5 grid-mini
step 1: grid
step 2: B1 at 1A dir=right level=1
step 3: S1 at 1C dir=down level=1
step 4: L1 at 3E dir=up level=1
step 5: wire3 at 1A dir=down level=2
step 6: wire3 at 1E dir=right level=2
step 7: wire3 at 3C dir=up level=2
expect S1=on: L1 on
